---
// 观测成功率与覆盖率严密模型计算器 (Metric Calculator)
---

<div class="rounded-xl border border-[#26354D] bg-[#111C2E] p-5 sm:p-6 text-[#E6EDF6] space-y-4 my-6">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#26354D]">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
      <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]"></span>
      <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold tracking-tight">观测成功率与覆盖率计算器 (Metric Calculator)</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#38BDF8] bg-[#38BDF8]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#38BDF8]/30">数学严密模型</span>
  </div>

  <p class="text-xs text-[#A7B6CC] leading-relaxed">
    依据本站《测速与稳定性测量方法论》，严禁将离散探测伪造成时间可用率。输入计划槽位与探测样本，实时计算<strong>有效观测成功率</strong>与<strong>计划覆盖率</strong>：
  </p>

  <!-- Input Form -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 bg-[#0B1220] p-4 rounded-lg border border-[#26354D] text-xs font-mono">
    <div>
      <label class="block text-[#A7B6CC] mb-1">计划总槽位 (E):</label>
      <input id="input-e" type="number" min="1" value="100" class="w-full bg-[#111C2E] border border-[#26354D] rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#E6EDF6]" />
      <span class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">计划探测总次数</span>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label class="block text-[#10B981] mb-1 font-bold">探测成功 (S):</label>
      <input id="input-s" type="number" min="0" value="95" class="w-full bg-[#111C2E] border border-[#26354D] rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#E6EDF6]" />
      <span class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">连接正常且返回200</span>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label class="block text-[#EF4444] mb-1 font-bold">明确失败 (F):</label>
      <input id="input-f" type="number" min="0" value="3" class="w-full bg-[#111C2E] border border-[#26354D] rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#E6EDF6]" />
      <span class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">超时或连接被拒绝</span>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label class="block text-[#64748B] mb-1">探针未知 (U):</label>
      <input id="input-u" type="number" min="0" value="2" class="w-full bg-[#111C2E] border border-[#26354D] rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-[#E6EDF6]" />
      <span class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">探针自身故障无数据</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Calculated Output Cards -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <!-- Success Rate Card -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-[#0B1220] border border-[#10B981]/40 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2">
      <div>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#A7B6CC]">有效观测成功率 S / (S + F)</div>
        <div id="metric-success-rate" class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-[#10B981] mt-1">96.94%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[11px] text-[#A7B6CC]">
        公式：在有效捕获的 <span id="metric-valid-count" class="font-mono text-[#E6EDF6]">98</span> 次样本中，成功率为有效探测占比。
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Coverage Rate Card -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-[#0B1220] border border-[#38BDF8]/40 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2">
      <div>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#A7B6CC]">计划覆盖率 (S + F) / E</div>
        <div id="metric-coverage-rate" class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-[#38BDF8] mt-1">98.00%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[11px] text-[#A7B6CC]">
        公式：排除未知盲区后，实际完成有效探测的时间覆盖度。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Boundary & Anti-Fraud Notice -->
  <div class="p-3 rounded bg-[#0B1220]/60 border border-[#26354D] text-[11px] text-[#A7B6CC] leading-relaxed space-y-1">
    <div class="text-[#E6EDF6] font-bold">行业防欺诈避坑说明：</div>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5 text-[#64748B]">
      <li>若有效采样总数为 0，成功率显示为“不可计算 (N/A)”，绝不欺骗用户显示 100%。</li>
      <li>离散探针成功率 96.94% 仅代表探测瞬间的状态，<strong>绝不等于整月在线时长为 96.94%</strong>。</li>
      <li>本站拒绝使用“30天无故障绿格子”忽悠读者，无长期持续监控时均如实呈现离散快照。</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  const inE = document.getElementById('input-e') as HTMLInputElement;
  const inS = document.getElementById('input-s') as HTMLInputElement;
  const inF = document.getElementById('input-f') as HTMLInputElement;
  const inU = document.getElementById('input-u') as HTMLInputElement;

  const outSuccess = document.getElementById('metric-success-rate');
  const outCoverage = document.getElementById('metric-coverage-rate');
  const outValid = document.getElementById('metric-valid-count');

  function calculateMetrics() {
    const E = parseFloat(inE?.value || '0');
    const S = parseFloat(inS?.value || '0');
    const F = parseFloat(inF?.value || '0');
    const U = parseFloat(inU?.value || '0');

    const valid = S + F;
    if (outValid) outValid.textContent = `${valid}`;

    // Success rate S / (S + F)
    if (outSuccess) {
      if (valid <= 0) {
        outSuccess.textContent = '不可计算 (N/A)';
        outSuccess.className = 'text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-[#64748B] mt-1';
      } else {
        const rate = (S / valid) * 100;
        outSuccess.textContent = `${rate.toFixed(2)}%`;
        outSuccess.className = `text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono mt-1 ${rate >= 95 ? 'text-[#10B981]' : (rate >= 80 ? 'text-[#F59E0B]' : 'text-[#EF4444]')}`;
      }
    }

    // Coverage rate (S + F) / E
    if (outCoverage) {
      if (E <= 0) {
        outCoverage.textContent = '0.00%';
      } else {
        const cov = Math.min(100, (valid / E) * 100);
        outCoverage.textContent = `${cov.toFixed(2)}%`;
      }
    }
  }

  [inE, inS, inF, inU].forEach((el) => {
    el?.addEventListener('input', calculateMetrics);
  });
  calculateMetrics();
</script>
